Z||000018||rockcrawl||12-05-2001||03:42 PM||||I wouldn't even drive the car with a stock 5 liter chip. It's too far off and would likely cause damage to the engine. If you are using a 730 to run a 4.9, you will need a custom chip. I have absolutely no plans of marketing any kind of kit or parts to do this, I'm just sharing my experience. ||||reg||1
